&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ben jij de influencer-goeroe die wij zoeken?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Volg jij de nieuwste features op Instagram, TikTok, YouTube en Snapchat op de voet? Weet jij precies welke influencers op dit moment hot zijn? Beheers je zowel het Nederlands als het Engels vloeiend? Dan maken we graag kennis met je!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Over WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is een dochteronderneming van WPP, het wereldwijde advertisingconglomeraat. We ondersteunen toonaangevende mediabureaus zoals Wavemaker, Mindshare en EssenceMediacom. Binnen WPP Media zijn verschillende centrale activiteiten ondergebracht, waaronder StudioM, Digital Data Hub, Business Intelligence, Proces Management, Marketing Services &amp;amp; Insights, Trading en Quality Management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is een dynamische, jonge en ambitieuze organisatie met duizenden (young) professionals wereldwijd. In Nederland hebben we kantoren in Amsterdam, Eindhoven en Sittard. Daar werken honderden collega’s voor toonaangevende klanten zoals Action, Lamb Weston, NS, Subway, M&amp;amp;M’s, Brabantia, IKEA en Dr. Oetker.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ons kantoor in Amsterdam biedt een adembenemend uitzicht van 180 graden over de stad en de Amstel. De sfeer is informeel en gezellig, met regelmatig vrijdagmiddagborrels in onze skybar op de negende verdieping.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Over StudioM en de functie&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Je gaat aan de slag bij StudioM, ons interne bureau voor influencer marketing. We voeren campagnes uit op grote, vaak internationale schaal. Je werkt met een breed scala aan klanten, influencers en campagnes, waardoor geen dag hetzelfde is.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In deze rol draag je zelfstandig de operationele verantwoordelijkheid voor complexe en omvangrijke projecten. Denk aan multi-marketprojecten, strategische accounts, campagnes voor meerdere merken en innovatieve trajecten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat ga je doen?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Projectmanagement: Je bent zelfstandig verantwoordelijk voor het opzetten, uitvoeren en coördineren van influencer marketingcampagnes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planning en voortgang: Je stuurt de dagelijkse uitvoering aan, maakt duidelijke projectplanningen en bewaakt deadlines, afhankelijkheden, prioriteiten en de voortgang van projecten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influencerselectie en briefings: Je vertaalt de kaders en briefings van de accountmanager naar concrete selectielijsten, taken en creatieve briefings, waaronder influencerbriefings. Waar nodig verdeel je taken onder junior collega’s of stagiairs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relatiebeheer en onderhandelingen: Je onderhoudt relaties met influencers en talentbureaus en onderhandelt zelfstandig over marktconforme vergoedingen binnen het vastgestelde budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budgetbeheer en administratie: Je beheert projectbudgetten en houdt kosten bij, zoals influencer fees, buy-outs en event- en productiekosten. Ook verzorg je contracten en regel je boekingen met bureaus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Content en kwaliteit: Je bewaakt de voortgang en kwaliteit van alle content en deliverables, voert eerste contentchecks uit en werkt nauw samen met accountmanagers richting definitieve goedkeuring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Afstemming en rapportage: Je werkt samen met interne teams om effectieve campagnes te realiseren. Je houdt klanten, stakeholders en de accountmanager proactief op de hoogte van de dagelijkse voortgang, sluit waar nodig aan bij klantupdates en rapporteert over resultaten en aandachtspunten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risicobeheersing en optimalisatie: Je signaleert risico’s, knelpunten en optimalisatiemogelijkheden, bespreekt deze met de (senior) accountmanager en escaleert tijdig waar nodig. Je stuurt actief bij, optimaliseert lopende campagnes en voert verbeteringen door met medior- en juniorcollega’s.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluatie en begeleiding: Je levert inhoudelijke input voor projectevaluaties, vertaalt learnings naar verbeteringen voor toekomstige campagnes en begeleidt en werkt stagiairs in binnen het team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat breng je mee?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je hebt een passie voor influencer marketing en leeft social media. Je kijkt liever YouTube en TikTok dan televisie en denkt in Instagram Stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je volgt de nieuwste features en ontwikkelingen op socialmediaplatformen en weet welke influencers op dit moment relevant zijn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je begrijpt hoe platformen als Facebook, Instagram, YouTube, TikTok en Snapchat werken en houdt hun innovaties bij.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent creatief, maar werkt ook gestructureerd en gecoördineerd.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je beheerst het Nederlands en Engels vloeiend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ jaar ervaring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent hands-on en zorgt ervoor dat campagnes tot in de puntjes geregeld zijn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat bieden wij?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Een boeiende baan in een vooruitstrevend en informeel team binnen een van de grootste communicatiegroepen ter wereld. Je krijgt de mogelijkheid om je talenten verder te ontwikkelen in een inspirerende werkomgeving. En natuurlijk werk je met fijne collega’s in ons geweldige kantoor, die iedere werkdag bijzonder maken.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salaris: €3.800 - €5.800&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(op basis van 38,75 uur per week).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Toegang tot M Academy:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Voor uitgebreide trainingen en workshops in zowel hard als soft skills, inclusief specifieke AI-trainingen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Werken voor grote (internationale) merken en klanten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een zelfstandige rol met veel vrijheid.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;De kans om een breder perspectief binnen influencer marketing en social media te ontwikkelen en kennis vanuit de wereld van mediabureaus op te doen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Werken binnen een energiek, ambitieus en gezellig team met focus op AI-transformatie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open communicatie en een fijne werksfeer waarin iedereen zichzelf kan zijn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Goede arbeidsvoorwaarden en ontwikkelmogelijkheden.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een fijne kantoorplek op een mooie locatie in Amsterdam (Rivierenbuurt);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een team met veel kennis, kunde en gezelligheid;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vrijdagmiddag borrels en events op onze rooftop aan de Amstel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mental Wellbeing:&lt;/strong&gt; Toegang tot ons well being platform Telus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reiskostenvergoeding:&lt;/strong&gt; Reiskosten worden volledig vergoed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8% vakantiegeld en 26 vakantiedagen per jaar&lt;/strong&gt; (plus 9 extra bij te kopen!).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Working allowance:&lt;/strong&gt; €30 netto per maand bij fulltime.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring Your Own Device (BYOD):&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Je ontvangt een maandelijkse telefoonvergoeding van €57,50 netto.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Klaar voor de volgende stap in je carrière?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Solliciteer nu en word onderdeel van ons ambitieuze team!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is looking for a Senior / Lead Program Manager to help develop and execute our asset-light model for expanding AI infrastructure through partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work at the intersection of strategy, finance, commercial negotiations and execution. Your focus will be to turn complex partnership opportunities into clear business cases, workable commercial terms and agreements that support the needs of Nebius, our partners and our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role suits someone who combines structured problem-solving with strong financial understanding and the ability to move work forward across multiple teams. You should be comfortable assessing commercial trade-offs, bringing clarity to ambiguous problems and taking responsibility for progress.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an individual contributor role with significant cross-functional responsibility. You will lead projects and influence stakeholders without direct line-management responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop commercial frameworks and term sheets.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Define proposed terms for asset-light partnerships, balancing financial returns, risk, responsibilities and the interests of Nebius and its partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support the partnership team&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;Build the operational framework, track and report progress, develop commercial guidelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build business cases with Finance.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Coordinate the analysis supporting partnership proposals, working through financial models, testing assumptions and assessing how different commercial terms affect the economics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape contractual and legal structures.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Partner with Legal and relevant business teams to translate the commercial model into practical structures and agreements for partners and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive cross-functional execution.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Bring together Finance, Legal, commercial, technical and operational stakeholders, establishing clear ownership, resolving dependencies and maintaining momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prepare decisions and recommendations.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Turn complex information into clear options, explain trade-offs and help stakeholders reach informed decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop repeatable ways of working.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Capture lessons from individual partnerships and improve the frameworks, templates and processes that support the model as it grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in management consulting or a strategy and operations role within a technology business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with the ability to break down unfamiliar, complex problems and develop practical recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial fluency: you can read and work with financial models, challenge assumptions and explain the commercial implications of the numbers. A specialist financial analyst background is not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing business cases, assessing commercial opportunities or supporting complex transactions and partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence working with commercial terms and contracts alongside finance and legal specialists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management skills, including the ability to align teams with different priorities and influence without formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The initiative and judgment to drive projects independently, manage ambiguity and recognise when a decision needs wider input.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written and verbal communication, particularly when presenting analysis and recommendations to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Revenue operations background: Supporting sales or partnership teams with clear processes, compensation structure etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience that would be valuable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on large, complex projects in data centres, digital infrastructure, real estate, power or related sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Revenue operations background: supporting sales or partnership teams with clear processes, compensation structure etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to partnership models, infrastructure economics or arrangements involving several commercial counterparties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience taking a strategic recommendation through negotiation and into implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sector experience is valuable, but we are also interested in strong generalists who can learn a new business model quickly and apply sound commercial judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Why join Nebius&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is scaling a new generation of AI infrastructure across EMEA. You will have genuine ownership of how that infrastructure is designed, standardised and delivered, working on complex projects where technical judgement has a direct impact on speed, capacity and long-term operational performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation and benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth and continuous learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility, trust and real ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An international environment with highly experienced technical teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to shape infrastructure that powers the next generation of AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is an equal opportunity employer committed to an inclusive workplace. We provide equal employment opportunities and do not discriminate on any characteristic protected by applicable law. Please tell us if you need an accommodation during the application process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and innovative culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on impactful AI projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International environment and talented teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s it like to work at Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast moving&amp;nbsp;- Bold thinking&amp;nbsp;- Constant growth&amp;nbsp;- Meaningful impact&amp;nbsp;- Trust and real ownership&amp;nbsp;- Opportunity to shape the future of AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and diverse workplace and to providing equal employment opportunities in all aspects of employment. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, ancestry, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work in the country in which they apply and will be required to provide proof of employment eligibility as a condition of hire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Hudl, we build great teams. We hire the best of the best to ensure you’re working with people you can constantly learn from. You’re trusted to get your work done your way while testing the limits of what’s possible and what’s next. We work hard to provide a culture where everyone feels supported, and our employees feel it—their votes helped us become one of the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/blog/hudl-2026-top-100-inspiring-workplaces?utm_medium=internal&amp;amp;utm_source=job-ad&amp;amp;utm_campaign=26_NA_talent_job-ad&amp;amp;utm_content=1org_learn-more_blog-link_learn-more_2blog_organic_3ctw&quot;&gt;Top 100 Inspiring Workplaces&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We think of ourselves as the team behind the team, supporting the lifelong impact sports can have: the lessons in teamwork and dedication; the influence of inspiring coaches; and the opportunities to reach new heights. That’s why we help teams from all over the world see their game differently. Our products make it easier for coaches and athletes at any level to capture video, analyze data, share highlights and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to join us?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;padding: 56.25% 0 0 0; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://player.vimeo.com/video/1095624224?h=9e8cdc9dbe&amp;amp;badge=0&amp;amp;autopause=0&amp;amp;player_id=0&amp;amp;app_id=58479&quot; width=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Your Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Scrum Master to join our team in London. Our products help the world&#39;s top teams and athletes perform at their best. We need an experienced Agile leader to help the squads building them do the same.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior ScrumMaster, you&#39;ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coach the system, not just the team.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll guide squads toward high autonomy while focusing on broader organizational design issues, such as resolving friction across business units, managing dependencies, and establishing scaling patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect outcomes, not processes.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll move fluidly across frameworks, adapting events to what the team needs to deliver value. You will act as an outcome architect, designing information flow and decision rhythms rather than functioning as a framework fundamentalist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anticipate, not react.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll utilize predictive delivery intelligence and cross-team dependency mapping to resolve impediments before they surface, keeping coordination moving in the right direction even as the pace of delivery accelerates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foster psychological safety.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll build environments where candor is safe, failure is treated as a data point, and conflict is constructive. You&#39;ll ensure teams feel secure enough to take on hard problems and navigate the shifting dynamics brought on by AI-assisted development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Align and design for visibility.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll map value streams to see where decisions stall and design cross-BU communication layers. You will maintain the signal through the noise, ensuring stakeholders know what&#39;s changed and what decisions are needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Time spent collaborating with your teammates in-office will be a regular part of how you work. We&#39;re currently considering applicants within commuting distance of our London office. You&#39;ll be expected to work more days in-office than remote, but will have the freedom to coordinate your specific in-office schedule with your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Must-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An experienced Agile practitioner. &lt;/strong&gt;You have three or more years as a Scrum Master and have guided squads to improved, sustainable results and can scale your coaching capacity to influence broader organizational maturity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A systems thinker.&lt;/strong&gt; You see beyond the squad level, actively identifying and breaking down siloed organizational designs to reduce friction and eliminate duplicated efforts across Business Units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-driven and predictive. &lt;/strong&gt;You know how to use both qualitative and quantitative signals to establish predictive metrics that forecast delivery risk and guide investment decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A clear communicator.&lt;/strong&gt; You design lightweight operating guardrails and information flows that keep dependencies transparent and align stakeholders at every level without creating overhead that slows teams down.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A champion of responsible speed.&lt;/strong&gt; You optimize for quality, anticipated dependencies, commitments kept, and team sustainability, ensuring that the speed of code generation never outpaces our coordination speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice-to-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI fluency.&lt;/strong&gt; You have an interest in or experience with AI-assisted development tools and AI-powered agile tools, such as automated bottleneck detection or real-time sentiment and health monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A diverse Agile toolbelt. &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re familiar with multiple frameworks (Kanban, Lean, SAFe, etc) and know when and how to blend them for better outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global team experience. &lt;/strong&gt;Our product teams span the U.S. and Europe, and you&#39;re comfortable collaborating across time zones and cultures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion work-life harmony.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;ll give you the flexibility you need in your work life (e.g., flexible vacation time above any required statutory leave, company-wide holidays, remote work options and more) so you can enjoy your personal life too. Plus, every five years, we give you a paid sabbatical to unplug and recharge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guarantee autonomy.&lt;/strong&gt; We have an open, honest culture and we trust our people from day one. Your team will support you, but you&#39;ll own your work and have the agency to try new ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Encourage career growth.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re lifelong learners who encourage professional development. We&#39;ll give you tons of resources and opportunities to keep growing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide an environment to help you succeed.&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;ve invested in our offices, designing incredible spaces with our employees in mind. But whether you&#39;re at the office or working remotely, we&#39;ll provide you the tech you need to do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your wellbeing.&lt;/strong&gt; Depending on location, we offer medical and retirement benefits for employees—but no matter where you&#39;re located, we have resources like our Employee Assistance Program and employee resource groups to support your mental health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is displayed below—&lt;strong&gt;starting salaries will typically fall near the middle of this range.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make compensation decisions based on an individual&#39;s experience, skills and education in line with our internal pay equity practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will also be eligible for a long-term incentive (LTI) award. Any bonuses awarded are based on individual and company performance paid at Hudl&#39;s discretion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£48,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£80,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/jobs/hudl-applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hudl Applicant and Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Horizon Software ?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une Fintech spécialisée dans la conception d’une plateforme facilitant les différentes activités de trading sur les marchés financiers électroniques (automatisation de certaines activités (Market Making, Algo Trading...), gestion des ordres et exécutions de manière optimale (Agency Trading, Order and Execution Management System…),&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un logiciel à la fine pointe de la technologie déployée sur site ou en SaaS,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une roadmap produit ambitieuse : Machine Learning, IA, Crypto Currencies, Low Latency…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une société à taille humaine (160 collaborateurs) où vous pouvez faire une différence,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une société internationale présente dans 6 pays pour servir des clients répartis sur 26 pays,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une société engagée : certifié B-Corp, partenaire de Planet Tech’care, Ethical IA et Lakaa, fond de dotation,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une&amp;nbsp;société reconnue et récompensée pour son expertise technologique : Best Sell-Side EMS (TradingTech Insight Awards Europe 2026), Best Sell-Side OMS (TradingTech Insight Awards Europe 2025) et Best Multi-Asset Trading System of the Year (FOW International Awards 2025).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votre quotidien ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que Trading Application Support Specialist&amp;nbsp;dans le cadre d’un &lt;strong&gt;stage de longue durée de 4 à 6 mois basé à Paris ou Dubai&lt;/strong&gt;, vous intégrerez une équipe de 5 personnes et vous aurez comme objectif principal d’assurer avec succès, le déploiement de nos solutions chez nos clients (brokers, banques d’investissement, places boursières...) :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Etablir un contact direct avec le client tout le long du process de résolution des incidents et être le garant de la bonne utilisation du logiciel chez le client,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyser les incidents et définir leur niveau de criticité, selon les process et outils mis à disposition,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prendre en charge les sollicitations du client jusqu’à leur résolution ou escalade, préconisant des solutions de contournement si nécessaire,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Déployer et installer nos solutions ou des nouvelles fonctionnalités chez le client Former les clients (utilisateurs et équipes IT) à nos solutions,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partager avec les équipes Client Delivery Manager dédiées et Engineering les enjeux et attendus client.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Les plus de ce poste : &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travailler dans un environnement dynamique et stimulant techniquement et fonctionnellement,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Faire partie d’une équipe de Client Support talentueux et experts dans leur domaine,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avoir l’opportunité de travailler sur des sujets variés dans un environnement international,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Des évènements réguliers (déjeuners, afterworks, sensibilisation autour du climat...)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equipe à taille humaine avec un management local et de proximité,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salaire compétitif et avantages sociaux,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un programme d’onboarding dédié et personnalisé avec un mentor pour vous accompagner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Et si c’était vous ? &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diplômé d’un BAC+5 en informatique, vous souhaitez travailler sur un poste alliant relation client et analyse technique,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous recherchez un stage de longue durée, de 4 à 6 mois,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez un intérêt pour la finance de marché et le trading,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Le sens du service client, d’excellentes compétences interpersonnelles, de communication et un esprit d’équipe sont des qualités qui vous décrivent,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez une bonne capacité d’analyse, de synthèse et de rédaction et parlez couramment anglais (oral et écrit),&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;La connaissance de base des systèmes d&#39;exploitation Linux, de l&#39;administration système, de tous les langages OO et expérience SDLC est un plus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
