&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics Engineering Manager - Fincrime&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;London/Cardiff/UK Remote | 💰£97,800-£125,000 + Incentive Awards tied to your performance and&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt; benefits&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U62l09nB0M4&quot;&gt; Hear from the team&lt;/a&gt; ✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⭐Our Fincrime Analytics Engineering Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Financial Crime Collective helps keep Monzo and our customers safe. We build effective, proportionate controls to protect against financial crime while delivering great customer outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Analytics Engineering discipline works in the intersection between data, engineering and our collectives - Core, Money, Borrowing, Operations and Financial Crime and beyond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AE teams are responsible for building downstream data models from backend services with the desire to make our Data Warehouse a genuine competitive advantage for Monzo. We want a discipline capable of building a reliable and scalable Data Warehouse to support decision making in a cost effective and performant manner.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Managers within Data have two primary responsibilities; people and technical products. Your focus will be on helping engineers with their personal and professional development, listening and guiding them through hard times and celebrating their successes. You will also be leading and participating directly in technical initiatives and helping Monzo shape its Data organisation, ensuring the team focuses on valuable work, shipping things with a level of care and attention to detail.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There will be a strong focus on delivering best practice across our data discipline and helping bring a new level of maturity around Data Governance principles, working in collaboration with others to deliver this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑You’ll play a key role by...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working in a multi-disciplinary team, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a hands-on leader in building a discipline of exceptional analytics engineers working to make Data at Monzo the gold standard within the industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nurture between 5 to 6 analytics engineers, supporting, coaching and developing high performing engineers through regular 1:1s, continuous feedback and relationships with others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aid prioritisation of initiatives and projects, working closely with other leads for each of our Monzo collectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be hands on through participating in the review cycle, architecture and design leadership and development of your own changes to the pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of the hiring team within Analytics Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with other leads to deliver a scalable, consistent approach to governance and best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive effective project management of central Analytics Engineering projects, ensuring they’re well scoped and delivered to deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish yourself as a trusted partner to various collectives and the leadership team, with the capacity for getting things done, be it either hands-on or by leading others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We all own and support the pipelines we contribute to, and on call support out of hours will be expected from time to time as part of this role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩We’d love to hear from you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have experience managing or mentoring the performance and development of high-performing engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong experience in data warehousing architecture at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience and a passion for leading data warehousing, data visualisation, big data or ETL projects as an analyst, developer, designer or architect&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know what it takes to hire great engineers within the data space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re equally comfortable working hands on and leading a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice To Haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Any experience working within a finance or banking environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a highly regulated environment (e.g. finance, insurance, gaming, food, health care)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with any of our stack of dbt, BigQuery and Looker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Not ticking every box? That’s totally okay! Studies show that women and people of colour might hesitate to apply unless they meet every single requirement. At Monzo, we’re dedicated to creating a diverse and welcoming team. If you’re passionate about this role and keen to learn and grow with us, we encourage you to apply— even if you don’t have everything that’s listed just yet. Drop us your application, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🙌What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰£97,800-£125,000 + Incentive Awards tied to your performance and&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt; benefits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✈️ We’ll help you relocate to the UK.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✅ We can sponsor your visa.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍This role can be based in our London office, but we&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK (with ad hoc meetings in London)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, and at times that suit you and your team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚£1,000 learning budget each year to use on books, training courses and conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏡We will set you up to work from home; all employees are given Macbooks and for fully remote workers we will provide extra support for your work-from-home setup.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➕ Plus lots more! &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Read our full list of benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌈&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; The application journey has 4 key steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiter Screening Call&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initial Call&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take Home Task&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final Loop (3 sessions - case study, collaboration and people&amp;nbsp; leadership)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This process should take around 2-3 weeks - your schedule is really important to us, so we promise to be as flexible as possible!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have some guidelines on using Artificial Intelligence (AI) to ace an application and interview at Monzo. &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/the-ultimate-guide-on-using-ai-to-ace-an-interview-at-monzo&quot;&gt;You can read them here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more insight into the AE team at Monzo, check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://open.spotify.com/episode/6Eg1mNXROTiEXBUVmIQSil?si=jo5cymfpQNWbMJ5DGdLJHQ&quot;&gt;podcast&lt;/a&gt; with John Azzopardi one of our Senior Leaders in AE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-AS1 #LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunities for everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity and inclusion are a priority for us and we’re making sure we have lots of support for all of our people to grow at Monzo. At Monzo, we’re embracing diversity by fostering an inclusive environment for all people to do the best work of their lives with us. This is integral to our mission of making money work for everyone. You can read more in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/diversity-and-inclusion&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, 2026 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/our-2026-diversity-and-inclusion-report&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion Report&lt;/a&gt; and 2025 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/gender-pay-gap-report-2025&quot;&gt;Gender Pay Gap Report.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to age, ethnicity, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, or veteran, neurodiversity or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a preferred name, please use it to apply. We don&#39;t need full or birth names at application stage 😊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;#LI-IV1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;content&quot; class=&quot;highlighter-context page view&quot; data-inline-comments-target=&quot;true&quot; data-remix-main-content=&quot;true&quot; data-testid=&quot;page-content-only&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_30huDKYbGa _24h04i2Njc _034jHtYbGa _313842dnbC _0adFHsIZbP _1DCdHiyFLW _2XsHFMIZbP _39xV02N91d&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;main-content&quot; class=&quot;wiki-content css-1i5i0uk e5xcnr80&quot; data-testid=&quot;pageContentRendererTestId&quot; data-vc=&quot;pageContentRendererTestId&quot; data-test-appearance=&quot;full-page&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;renderer-overrides&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;css-3qfej8&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ak-renderer-wrapper is-full-page css-pw7jst&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;css-11mnq1u&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ak-renderer-document&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;187&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6f66b3304019&quot;&gt;The Service Desk IT Operations Lead is the senior individual contributor on the Service Desk path and the senior technical escalation point for Service Desk across &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;EMEA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; and &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;APAC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. The role owns and improves Service Desk processes, runbooks, escalation paths, the employee hardware lifecycle and new-hire IT onboarding, administers Service Desk tooling on behalf of its owners, and leads improvement initiatives and cross-functional projects. It acts as the bridge between the Service Desk and Infrastructure, Enterprise Applications and Security, and leads through expertise, judgment and influence rather than formal authority. It carries no line-management responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;879&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c645114533a9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;11be38ca981c&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;903&quot; data-local-id=&quot;38d58248e3b1&quot;&gt;Serve as the final technical escalation point within Service Desk for high-severity, high-complexity and business-critical issues, before engagement of Infrastructure, Enterprise Applications, Security or vendors; coordinate major-incident response, communication and post-incident follow-through with the relevant teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1228&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d7a0b85de128&quot;&gt;Act as consultation point for L1/L2 on complex or unusual cases: advise on troubleshooting approach, ownership, escalation path and resolution before issues are escalated.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1403&quot; data-local-id=&quot;79197ef3d5ff&quot;&gt;Act as subject matter expert for the end-user computing environment: endpoints (Windows, macOS), mobile devices, identity and access (Entra ID / Active Directory, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;SSO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;MFA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;), Microsoft 365, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;MDM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, collaboration tools and meeting-room technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1649&quot; data-local-id=&quot;373bb2e063e6&quot;&gt;Administer and configure Service Desk tooling (e.g. Jira Service Management workflows and automation, device enrolment and &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;MDM&lt;/span&gt; policy, hardware asset management tooling) as agreed with the tool and platform owners, and propose and implement improvements, including request workflows and automations used by adjacent functions. Ownership of the tools and platforms sits with IT leadership and platform owners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2061&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d1c8fe9e90b1&quot;&gt;Administer selected corporate IT systems and services according to operational requirements, including access and permissions management, service configuration and automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2240&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1bff032a414c&quot;&gt;Maintain and improve Service Desk procedures, runbooks, escalation paths and knowledge base; propose technical standards for approval by Service Desk management and maintain them once approved; advise on operational priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2471&quot; data-local-id=&quot;eef532dfc55a&quot;&gt;Contribute to creating and updating documentation: runbooks, process documents, technical standards and knowledge-base articles, setting the standard for documentation quality across the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2667&quot; data-local-id=&quot;31771b1a2e51&quot;&gt;Analyze ticket, escalation and &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;SLA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; data to identify systemic issues and contribute to &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;SLA&lt;/span&gt; reporting; lead root-cause analysis and problem management; design process, tooling and automation changes that improve first-time resolution and reduce escalation volume.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2932&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7677c9383a4b&quot;&gt;Assess proposed solutions and operational changes for supportability and user impact; advise management and partner teams on the support implications of technology decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3110&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0def3a568ed8&quot;&gt;Provide organizational context on existing and legacy IT processes, systems, decisions and ownership structures; apply it when evaluating current processes, and improve legacy practices where appropriate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3318&quot; data-local-id=&quot;62eadc8a8a51&quot;&gt;Identify gaps or ambiguities in operational ownership and work with the relevant stakeholders to establish practical solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3449&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bd51ed379576&quot;&gt;Own and improve employee-lifecycle processes, including hardware provisioning and, with Onboarding and People teams, new-hire IT onboarding across &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;EMEA&lt;/span&gt; and &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;APAC&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3614&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2e52d4fe01ee&quot;&gt;Recommend standards for company-provided laptops, peripherals and other end-user equipment, balancing business need, supportability, lifecycle and market availability; maintain the approved standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3818&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c12e6b0be08d&quot;&gt;Own employee hardware lifecycle processes, provisioning, replacement, reuse, return, disposal and employee resale, and provide demand forecasts and regional requirements (including Bill &amp;amp; Hold) to IT Supply Chain and Procurement; recommend routine purchases against agreed standards, approving only within a documented delegated spend limit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4163&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2a1e527f3510&quot;&gt;Lead and continuously improve equipment reuse and employee resale, including TechShop.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4253&quot; data-local-id=&quot;74b8adaf4413&quot;&gt;Contribute to forecasting and budget planning for employee technology and Service Desk requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4357&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8f5235a54054&quot;&gt;Support Service Desk contracts, renewals and licensing; maintain working relationships with hardware and Service Desk vendors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4487&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e9d102a5cacb&quot;&gt;Lead Service Desk projects, system migrations, new technology rollouts, process optimization, and contribute Service Desk expertise to company initiatives such as regional expansion, office launches, organizational changes and onboarding improvements, working with Infrastructure, Enterprise Applications, Security, HR/People, Onboarding, Recruiting, Procurement, Workplace/Facilities and the &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;AV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;/Builds team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4899&quot; data-local-id=&quot;91bc1761e199&quot;&gt;Advise partner functions on Service Desk capabilities, procedures, requirements and dependencies, and work with them to define and improve shared operational processes (e.g. joiner/mover/leaver with People, office launches with Workplace).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5142&quot; data-local-id=&quot;285e80a6e3d0&quot;&gt;Act as technical interviewer in Service Desk recruitment, providing structured feedback and hiring recommendations to management, and technical input to role requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5317&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9780204b4ad7&quot;&gt;Deliver technical onboarding for new team members and mentor L1 and L2 through joint troubleshooting, coaching and knowledge transfer, documenting approaches to reduce reliance on individual knowledge.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5522&quot; data-local-id=&quot;772b15110e33&quot;&gt;Stay hands-on: support the IT Bar, queue and events alongside L1/L2 when needed, and lead by example on ticket quality and communication.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5663&quot; data-local-id=&quot;146b9f785354&quot;&gt;Provide operational evidence for audits and compliance (including equipment lifecycle and offboarding); follow security, access-governance and procurement requirements; escalate material concerns to the appropriate owner.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5888&quot; data-local-id=&quot;eb5024856e6e&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We expect you to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7e5ce408e854&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5906&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2e0134fc5cec&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Information Technology or related field, or equivalent experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5997&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fd1086625afb&quot;&gt;5+ years of IT support or service desk experience with demonstrated progression in responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6099&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a5533bb5485f&quot;&gt;Advanced technical certifications (Microsoft 365, Azure, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;ITIL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Intermediate, Security+, etc.) strongly preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6215&quot; data-local-id=&quot;70d931eb497a&quot;&gt;Deep knowledge of enterprise IT systems, networks, and security practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6293&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1d671d9661d5&quot;&gt;Strong leadership, coaching, and collaboration skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6351&quot; data-local-id=&quot;68035fbe2ddf&quot;&gt;Proven ability to manage high-priority incidents and lead cross-functional troubleshooting efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6454&quot; data-local-id=&quot;42e1ed1ec464&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Related Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4c2a8c3a1840&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6478&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1d7c477c3408&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Knowledge &amp;amp; Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c6442bb30dcf&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6500&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6201abdc4e57&quot;&gt;Recognised expert in end-user computing and support operations, with breadth across endpoints, identity, collaboration, device management and security touch points.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6666&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4de70e5501b9&quot;&gt;Diagnoses ambiguous, cross-platform issues; experienced in root-cause analysis and process optimisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6772&quot; data-local-id=&quot;38a9483e5624&quot;&gt;Translates complex issues into clear guidance for technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6866&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9b59c05ded59&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Autonomy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f3fa01dee386&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6878&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ac00d8c8e653&quot;&gt;Operates with a high degree of independence and trusted judgment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6945&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e42c3ba8fbc1&quot;&gt;Takes the most sensitive escalations from intake to follow-up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7009&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b6840c2e8198&quot;&gt;Independently identifies improvements and drives them to completion; proactively pitches projects within the Service Desk domain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7140&quot; data-local-id=&quot;39901a9d8022&quot;&gt;Advises management and partner teams on the support implications of technology decisions. Significant spend, strategic or organisational changes, and decisions outside delegated authority are aligned with management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7362&quot; data-local-id=&quot;341f063d921e&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Complexity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d58f21e1a04e&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7376&quot; data-local-id=&quot;87a34b97b2e5&quot;&gt;Handles the most complex technical and operational problems in the support function: multiple systems, conflicting signals, incomplete data, elevated business risk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7542&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7519827d535a&quot;&gt;Leads escalations, often coordinating multiple IT functions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7604&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b392b04da178&quot;&gt;Designs and improves workflows and procedures where no precedent exists.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7682&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0cd98d0a9ee2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dd92537953a7&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7692&quot; data-local-id=&quot;949bd1de2fa4&quot;&gt;Broad impact on service reliability, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;SLA&lt;/span&gt; performance, support maturity and user experience across &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;EMEA&lt;/span&gt; and &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;APAC&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7806&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ebc6e83a03aa&quot;&gt;Reduces downtime, repeat incidents and escalation volume.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7865&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2a3af78999d8&quot;&gt;Shapes employee technology from onboarding through equipment return; ensures knowledge transfer and team readiness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7986&quot; data-local-id=&quot;18bfc1baa982&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;People / Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cb1823164d80&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;8009&quot; data-local-id=&quot;351c1bc9af51&quot;&gt;Leads through expertise, coordination and example, not formal authority.&lt;/p&gt;
