&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You are the expert navigator for our most complex client projects. As a Senior Implementation Consultant, you leverage your deep industry knowledge and technical expertise to steer global automotive and leasing giants through critical software implementations. You don&#39;t just configure a system; you design the future operational landscape of our clients. In this pivotal role within a hidden champion of mobility tech, you act as a mentor to your team and a strategic partner to our customers, ensuring that our software &quot;&lt;strong&gt;Miles&lt;/strong&gt;&quot; delivers maximum impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You take full ownership of large-scale implementation projects, from initial scoping to final delivery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You analyze intricate business requirements and design sophisticated solutions that push the boundaries of what is possible with Miles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You act as a primary point of contact for key stakeholders, managing expectations and building strong, trust-based relationships&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You mentor and coach junior and mid-level consultants, fostering a culture of excellence and continuous learning within the team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You identify opportunities for process improvements and contribute to the strategic roadmap of our implementation methodology&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You collaborate closely with product management and development teams to translate market needs into new software features&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Your skills and interests:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You have built an impressive track record in software implementation, IT consulting, or business analysis over several years&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You possess expert-level knowledge of the automotive finance, leasing, or fleet management industry&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You thrive in challenging environments and have successfully managed complex projects with multiple stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You are passionate about sharing your knowledge and have experience in leading or mentoring teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You combine strong analytical skills with a pragmatic, solution-oriented mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You communicate fluently in German and English and enjoy working in a diverse, international setting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Sofico, you’ll join an international, multicultural company with over 30 years of success. We double in size every five years, staying true to our open and collaborative culture even as we grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe you should be in control of your own career. That’s why we put your personal development first. With an extensive onboarding program, you’ll spend six months learning our products and getting to know the organization with the support of a dedicated job coach. Your learning doesn’t stop there; we’ll continue to offer opportunities for growth and development throughout your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work in a modern, accessible office with flexible and hybrid work options that allow you to balance work and life. In addition, we offer:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Flexible working hours and the option to work from home. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Employee discounts, eGym Wellpass, Bike Leasing and a subsidized Jobticket for public transportation. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Company pension scheme with optional additional occupational disability insurance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Growth potential through personalized learning and development plans.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A vibrant team culture with regular team events and a company weekend. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;Ingénieur(e) développement logiciel - Backend&amp;nbsp; - Sécurité - Login (f/m/d)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;L’équipe Login est le pilier de l’écosystème Decathlon. Composée de profils passionnés et multiculturels, notre équipe d&#39;une dizaine de personnes construit une solution d’authentification sécurisée et haute performance pour plus de 80 pays. Notre ambition ? Offrir une expérience membre fluide via un point d’entrée unique et hautement sécurisé. Notre défi actuel est de taille : mener une migration d&#39;architecture d&#39;envergure internationale depuis notre système Spring Security 5 vers Spring Security 7. Rejoins une équipe de passionné·es au cœur des enjeux globaux de Decathlon !&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La mission principale est d’accompagner la création de nouvelles fonctionnalités et l’amélioration de l’application, le tout tournant autour d’une organisation s’appuyant sur un écosystème agile afin de délivrer rapidement et fréquemment le plus de valeur possible à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contexte DevSecOps : you build it, you run it, you enjoy it !&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security by Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Standard OAuth 2.1 / OIDC&lt;/strong&gt; : Contribuer à l&#39;implémentation de ces protocoles pour garantir des accès sécurisés à nos services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sécurisation du Code&lt;/strong&gt; : Appliquer les principes de sécurité dès la conception (OWASP, protection contre les injections, gestion sécurisée du cycle de vie des sessions).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Veille Sécurité&lt;/strong&gt; : Identifier et corriger proactivement les failles potentielles au sein de l&#39;écosystème Java/Spring.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Administration Cloudflare :&lt;/strong&gt; Gérer, configurer et optimiser notre infrastructure Cloudflare (WAF, protection DDoS, DNS, CDN, Gestion des Bots).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit et Monitoring :&lt;/strong&gt; Mettre en place la surveillance des menaces, analyser les logs de sécurité et réagir aux incidents (SOC/SIEM).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Développement &amp;amp; Delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Production : Assurer le delivery sur les briques core du CIAM (moteurs d&#39;authentification, gestion des jetons, intégrations protocolaires).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Patterns Avancés : Implémenter des solutions résilientes basées sur Kafka (Patterns CDC &amp;amp; Outbox) pour garantir la cohérence des données sans compromettre la performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Qualité Intégrée : Garantir la stabilité via des tests automatisés rigoureux (Playwright, Gatling) dès la phase de développement.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Pilotage par la Donnée : Tracking &amp;amp; A/B Testing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Expérimentation : Mettre en œuvre des stratégies d&#39;A/B testing via Statsig pour valider les évolutions du tunnel d&#39;authentification de manière granulaire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tracking Comportemental : Intégrer et maintenir un tracking précis via Amplitude pour analyser les parcours utilisateurs et identifier les points de friction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Performance Produit : Collaborer avec les équipes Produit pour traduire les besoins business en implémentations techniques mesurables et scalables.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture, Scale &amp;amp; Observabilité&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conception Système : Modéliser les flux complexes via le C4 Model pour assurer une vision claire des interactions entre services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure &amp;amp; Ops :&lt;/strong&gt; Déployer et opérer tes services sur &lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt; (Helm), avec une maîtrise totale de l&#39;observabilité via &lt;strong&gt;Datadog&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE TU APPORTES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;+7 ans en Java&lt;/strong&gt; dans des environnements distribués à fort trafic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compétence sécurité :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standard &lt;strong&gt;OAuth 2.1 / OIDC&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expérience sur &lt;strong&gt;Keycloak&lt;/strong&gt; ou équivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sécurisation du Code (OWASP, injections, sessions sécurisées)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spring &amp;amp; Spring Security :&lt;/strong&gt; Connaissance des mécanismes internes (Filters, Authentication Providers, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Event-Driven Architecture :&lt;/strong&gt; Expérience sur &lt;strong&gt;Kafka&lt;/strong&gt;, CDC et utilisation du pattern Outbox.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Growth :&lt;/strong&gt; Expérience sur des outils de tracking (&lt;strong&gt;Amplitude&lt;/strong&gt;) et de Feature Flagging / A/B testing (&lt;strong&gt;Statsig&lt;/strong&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; Tools :&lt;/strong&gt; Kubernetes, Helm, Datadog.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testing :&lt;/strong&gt; Playwright (E2E) et Gatling/Blazemeter (Load testing).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Langue :&lt;/strong&gt; Anglais technique (documentation impérative).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CE QUE NOUS T’OFFRONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Organisation de travail hybride ;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Matériel fourni en accord avec tes missions et nos engagements sociétaux (Mac ou Windows) ;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une équipe de projet locale au sein d&#39;un réseau mondial (possibilité de carrière internationale) ;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Développement des compétences et accompagnement (diversité des projets, formations internes et externes, etc.) ;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Package de rémunération (actionnariat salarié, bonus mensuels/trimestriels).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NOTRE ENGAGEMENT EN FAVEUR DE L&#39;INCLUSION ET DE L&#39;ACCESSIBILITE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Decathlon, nous reconnaissons l&#39;immense valeur qu&#39;apporte la diversité à nos équipes et nous nous efforçons continuellement de favoriser et de cultiver un lieu de travail inclusif et équitable : c&#39;est pourquoi l&#39;Inclusion est l&#39;un de nos Fondamentaux Humains. Nous encourageons les personnes de tous horizons et de toutes capacités à postuler, car nous sommes convaincu·es que la diversité des pensées, des cultures, des identités et des expériences vécues nous rend plus fort·es.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decathlon s&#39;engage également à offrir un processus de sélection inclusif et accessible à tous les candidat·es. En cas de besoin d&#39;aménagement, tu peux en faire la demande via le formulaire de candidature, celle-ci sera confidentielle. Ces demandes n&#39;affectent pas le résultat du processus de recrutement&quot;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Host Broadcast Services (HBS) is a leading, independent host broadcast specialist, dedicated to helping international sports federations, organising committees, and rights holders deliver their events to a global audience. We provide world-class broadcast solutions for some of the world’s biggest sporting events, including the prestigious FIFA World Cup™, ensuring broadcasters worldwide can offer fans a unique and engaging viewing experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Zug, Switzerland, and as part of the Infront Sports &amp;amp; Media group, HBS offers the full spectrum of host broadcast operations and services — combining technological innovation with deep industry expertise to set the benchmark in live sports broadcasting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌍&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Senior Controlling Manager | Paris | 15-Month Contract | International Group Finance Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍&lt;strong&gt; Paris, France | International Media &amp;amp; Sports Environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💬&lt;strong&gt; Fluent in English and French.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📅 &lt;strong&gt;CDD - start early 2027 (15-Month Fixed-Term Contract with possible opportunities for extension)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you a senior finance professional looking for your next challenge in a dynamic, international business?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HBS is seeking an experienced Senior Controlling Manager to lead our international Controlling function on a 15-month fixed-term contract. Reporting to the Head of Finance, you will oversee a multi-country controlling team and play a key role in financial planning, reporting, project controlling, and strategic decision-making across our global operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading a Controlling team based across France, Switzerland, the UK and the USA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving financial performance reporting for projects, business units and international subsidiaries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing budgeting, forecasting, cash flow forecasting and monthly management reporting&lt;br&gt;Supporting strategic planning and business growth initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering with senior stakeholders across Finance, Operations and Executive Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to process improvements and ERP development initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years&#39; experience in Financial Controlling within an international environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership experience, ideally managing geographically dispersed teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of IFRS and project-based financial management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical and business partnering skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieved Master Degree (or equivalent) in Finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Excel capabilities; Business Central experience is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English required; French is beneficial&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an excellent opportunity for an experienced finance leader who enjoys working in a fast-paced, multicultural environment and wants to make an immediate impact within a globally recognised sports broadcast organisation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;HBS is committed to creating an inclusive and diverse workplace. We welcome applications from all qualified candidates and will provide reasonable adjustments to support candidates with disabilities or specific needs throughout the recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We thrive on delivering world-class broadcast solutions for major international events. We’re always looking for exceptional individuals who demonstrate:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Communication Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;– Fluent in English, able to navigate an international environment with clarity and professionalism.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Confident &amp;amp; Adaptable Team Players&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;– Thriving in fast-paced, live event settings, where collaboration is key to success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Excellence &amp;amp; Organisation&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;– Structured, detail-oriented, and proficient in the tools needed to keep operations seamless&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who is HBS?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ve probably watched a football game at some point in your life. Well, if it was a World Cup match, it was likely filmed and produced by the HBS (Host Broadcast Services) team. We are involved in the production of the following events: FIFA World Cup 26™, FIFA Women’s World Cup 2027™, Men’s Rugby World Cup 2027 Australia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find out more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hbs.tv/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.hbs.tv&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Due to the high volume of applications, we may not be able to respond individually to every candidate, but we will do our best to get back to you regarding next steps. Thank you for your interest in joining HBS.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account Executive, Strategic Deals - Attribute™&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;This is a &lt;strong&gt;fully remote&lt;/strong&gt; opportunity based out of any of the following with travel as needed: UK, Ireland, Netherlands, Sweden, Estonia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Become part of the team behind&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.doit.com/blog/why-we-are-launching-attribute?_gl=1*j8dlue*_up*MQ..*_ga*MTUwMzU2OTc0NS4xNzgzNDEzMDIx*_ga_Y90QRD61TR*czE3ODM0MTMwMjAkbzEkZzEkdDE3ODM0MTMwMzMkajQ3JGwwJGg2MjkyMjk4OTAkZDN4YlFHcnJpZVVJUzJiV2JORC02QXZmOGtLLWJzczczelE&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Attribute™&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;. Following our recent acquisition, we&#39;re bringing together visionary engineers and go-to-market leaders to disrupt cloud management with real-time, tagless cost visibility across cloud and AI workloads. As an Account Executive focused on Strategic Deals, you&#39;ll join a founding GTM movement inside an established market leader trusted by over 4,500 global customers, unlocking high-impact opportunities through top-tier strategic partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DoiT empowers cloud-native organizations to scale faster and innovate with confidence. By combining our Cloud Intelligence technology with Forward Deployed Engineers and deep specialization across AWS, Google Cloud, and Azure, we help tech-forward companies navigate their toughest infrastructure and cost governance challenges end to end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;As an Account Executive, Strategic Deals for &lt;strong&gt;Attribute™&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be at the forefront of building a brand-new region from scratch and introducing a groundbreaking solution to a fundamental business problem in modern FinOps. You will work on Strategic Deals, leveraging strategic partnerships with AWS, OpenAI, Top Private Equity firms, and our global current install base. A strong focus will be placed on co-selling and unlocking strategic deal opportunities with AWS, ISVs, and channel partners. Traditional cloud cost allocation methods rely heavily on static tagging—an approach that becomes obsolete in modern, shared cloud and AI infrastructure. When multi-tenant clusters, shared GPUs, microservices, and dynamic AI workloads dominate, organizations face severe blind spots: they cannot accurately determine the true cost-to-serve for specific applications, autonomous agents, or business teams, making it impossible to calculate true gross margins at a granular customer level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Attribute™ solves this by taking a completely different approach. Leveraging runtime eBPF technology, Attribute™ captures real-time network traffic signals and kernel-level observability without requiring engineering teams to manually tag or instrument code. By analyzing actual runtime consumption across CPU, GPU, memory, network, and AI model API requests, it provides accurate total cost of ownership (TCO) and unit economics based on real usage. Organizations finally get precise cost governance and gross margin visibility across complex cloud and AI environments with zero developer overhead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Executive building this region from scratch, you will establish a high-potential greenfield territory. You will drive sales end-to-end with a heavy emphasis on net-new logo acquisition, defining the regional go-to-market strategy and creating the foundational customer success stories that define this category.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own full-cycle deal execution across Startup, Digital Native, and Enterprise segments—prospecting new accounts, running compelling solution pitches, navigating complex technical evaluations alongside engineering partners, and closing strategic partnerships end to end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll have the rest of the Cloud Intelligence portfolio behind you: 4,500 customers, AWS/Google Cloud/Azure partnerships, and Forward Deployed Engineers who solve problems other vendors walk away from. But the product you&#39;ll carry every day is Attribute™, and the market is only just learning it exists. That&#39;s the opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Expect to travel 10–15% of the time to meet customers, engage with hyperscale teams, and show up at industry events that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full sales cycle from first conversation to closed deal, consistently hitting and exceeding quota and pipeline targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a high-volume pipeline and establish the region from scratch with a hunter mindset, driving outbound prospecting and net-new logo acquisition across EMEA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the first wave of reference customers and case studies the rest of the GTM org will run on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute a regional strategy that identifies high-growth opportunities and untapped markets across EMEA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build deep, mutually valuable relationships with AWS Sales Leaders and Partner Managers to co-sell and expand market share&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Forward Deployed Engineers and Solutions Architects to solve the toughest technical challenges prospects face&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain rigorous forecast accuracy in Salesforce and ensure every proposal reflects the quality of what we actually deliver&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide customers from initial curiosity through contract execution, setting them up for a world-class onboarding experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed real customer signal back to product and marketing every week — in a founding team, that loop is the job&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate your own pipeline through prospecting, networking, and creative outreach — not just working what&#39;s handed to you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of full-cycle B2B SaaS sales experience with a strong emphasis on net-new logo acquisition and building a regional territory from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of selling cloud services and understanding how consumption-based models work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hunting mentality: demonstrated drive to self-generate pipeline, prospect into target accounts, and close new business independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to platform engineering / DevOps teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort selling something new — you&#39;ve sold a product before there was a Gartner quadrant for it, and you preferred it that way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical curiosity: you understand the cloud computing market and can hold your own in conversations about AWS, Google Cloud, or Azure products and architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine interest in FinOps and how engineering organisations actually consume the cloud — you don&#39;t need to be a practitioner, but you need to care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build influential relationships across matrixed organisations and turn professional networks into real partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&quot;Roll up your sleeves&quot; attitude that pervades both sales and business development activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience at AWS, ISVs, or in strategic partnerships is a big plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are You a Doer?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Be your truest self. Work on your terms. Make a difference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are home to a global team of incredible talent who work remotely and have the flexibility to have a schedule that balances your work and home life. We embrace and support leveling up your skills professionally and personally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What does being a Do&#39;er mean? We&#39;re all about being entrepreneurial, pursuing knowledge, and having fun!&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doit.com/life-at-doit/&quot;&gt; Click here to learn more about our Life at DoiT&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sounds too good to be true? Check out our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.com/Overview/Working-at-DoiT-International-EI_IE1972488.11,29.htm&quot;&gt; Glassdoor reviews&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We thought so too, but we&#39;re here and happy we hit that &#39;apply&#39; button.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Full-time employee benefits include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited PTO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Working Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Stock Option Plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional Development Stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Peer Recognition Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Many Doers, One Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;DoiT unites as Many Do&#39;ers, One Team, where diversity is more than a goal — it&#39;s our strength. We actively cultivate an inclusive, equitable workplace, recognizing that each unique perspective enhances our innovation. By celebrating differences, we create an environment where every individual feels valued, contributing to our collective success.&lt;/p&gt;
